This plan records sources as of 13 October 2026. Each benchmark run must recapture the referenced source revision, license text/checksum, retrieval time, and attribution in `source-manifest.json`; upstream can change.

| Source | Verified current basis | Use in Curb | License/lineage treatment |
|---|---|---|---|
| [vercel/chatbot](https://github.com/vercel/chatbot) | Active public template; current `main` package metadata identifies Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, pnpm, Drizzle, Playwright, Biome, Husky, OpenTelemetry and AI SDK dependencies. Its [LICENSE](https://github.com/vercel/chatbot/blob/main/LICENSE) states Apache-2.0. | Reference application and controlled benchmark fixture, never an assertion about Vercel’s practices. | Pin a full commit SHA before every fixture build; retain NOTICE/license; keep local fixture modifications independently documented; do not imply Vercel endorsement. Re-validate license/NOTICE before redistribution. |
